+// the GPU reads and writes directly: anonymous mmap, optionally MADV_HUGEPAGE, bound to the NUMA nodes that have CPUs
+// when there is more than one node (on the GH200 node 1 is the HBM; this keeps the pages in Grace memory), populated
+// on the CPU so no GPU access ever faults, then cudaHostRegister'ed (the expert host bank's path, 345 GB/s over
